# Default apps. Installed by the installer but not required by the distro
# package, so they can be removed or swapped freely.
# One app per everyday need, chosen to follow the theme: GTK 4 / libadwaita
# apps take Noctalia's colours, btop has its own Noctalia template.
# More choices: `<id> app list`.
firefox
nautilus
gnome-text-editor
papers
loupe
showtime
decibels
gnome-calculator
btop
# Backups (encrypted, on a schedule); the first-login setup helps choose where.
pika-backup
gvfs
xdg-user-dirs
xdg-utils
